# Restart After Runtime Changes

- After completing or committing changes that affect a running application process, restart the affected process before handing the work back.
- Verify its health after restart, including any relevant worker heartbeat or application state endpoint.
- Restart only affected processes. Do not restart for documentation-only or test-only changes.
- If a safe restart or health check is unavailable, state that explicitly in the final response.
